{
  "id": "apply_patch",
  "title": "AI 改一千行程式碼，為什麼只回兩行？",
  "resolution": "720x1280",
  "characters": {
    "A": {
      "name": "企鵝燈",
      "role": "questioner",
      "color": "#FFD54F"
    },
    "B": {
      "name": "熊大",
      "role": "explainer",
      "color": "#81C784"
    }
  },
  "bgm": {
    "file": "bgm/bgm_haru_haru.mp3",
    "volume": 0.08
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "改一千行的程式，AI 只回兩行就改好？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0001_A.mp3",
      "start": 0.1,
      "end": 3.988
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那是增量補丁，不用重印整份檔案。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "增量補丁",
          "en": "Incremental Patch"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0002_B.mp3",
      "start": 4.108,
      "end": 7.444
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "打個比方，遊戲更新只下載改動的補丁。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0003_B.mp3",
      "start": 7.564,
      "end": 11.452
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "不用重載整個遊戲？省太多吧。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0004_A.mp3",
      "start": 11.572,
      "end": 15.124
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，重點是省 Token 消耗，省真金白銀。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "Token 消耗",
          "en": "Token Cost"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0005_B.mp3",
      "start": 15.244,
      "end": 19.468
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "模型按生成字數收費，字越多越貴。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0006_B.mp3",
      "start": 19.588,
      "end": 23.26
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "現在只貼改的兩行，省九成？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0007_A.mp3",
      "start": 23.38,
      "end": 26.62
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "不止省錢，回應速度也快很多。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "延遲",
          "en": "Latency"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0008_B.mp3",
      "start": 26.74,
      "end": 29.932
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "不用慢慢吐完整份，像捷運直達車。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0009_B.mp3",
      "start": 30.052,
      "end": 33.532
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那 AI 怎麼知道改哪裡？不會改錯？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0010_A.mp3",
      "start": 33.652,
      "end": 37.684
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "先比對上下文，鎖定正確位置。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "上下文對齊",
          "en": "Context Matching"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0011_B.mp3",
      "start": 37.804,
      "end": 41.068
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "只動局部，不碰其他程式碼。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0012_B.mp3",
      "start": 41.188,
      "end": 44.236
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "改最少、錯最少，聽起來很保險。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0013_A.mp3",
      "start": 44.356,
      "end": 47.788
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "凡事動腦子，先想清楚再下手。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0014_B.mp3",
      "start": 47.908,
      "end": 51.076
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "重寫整份常常漏東漏西，這招不會。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0015_B.mp3",
      "start": 51.196,
      "end": 55.084
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那一次能改幾個檔案？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0016_A.mp3",
      "start": 55.204,
      "end": 57.58
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "一個補丁能同時新增、修改、刪除。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0017_B.mp3",
      "start": 57.7,
      "end": 61.948
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "整批一起執行，不會改一半。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "原子性",
          "en": "Atomicity"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0018_B.mp3",
      "start": 62.068,
      "end": 65.116
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "一次辦三件事，這麼全能？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0019_A.mp3",
      "start": 65.236,
      "end": 68.188
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "要嘛全部成功，要嘛全部不算。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "事務",
          "en": "Transaction"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0020_B.mp3",
      "start": 68.308,
      "end": 71.716
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "失敗就是整批不作數，不半途而廢。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0021_B.mp3",
      "start": 71.836,
      "end": 75.388
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "全部不算？那不是白做工？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0022_A.mp3",
      "start": 75.508,
      "end": 78.628
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "不會，會整個回滾，回到改之前。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "回滾",
          "en": "Rollback"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0023_B.mp3",
      "start": 78.748,
      "end": 82.324
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "像網購退貨，退回原本狀態。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0024_B.mp3",
      "start": 82.444,
      "end": 85.54
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那改一半的爛攤子，誰收拾？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0025_A.mp3",
      "start": 85.66,
      "end": 88.612
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "乾淨退回，不留半改狀態。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0026_B.mp3",
      "start": 88.732,
      "end": 91.948
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "引擎先驗證，通過才准寫進檔案。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0027_B.mp3",
      "start": 92.068,
      "end": 95.428
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那補丁對不上，怎麼辦？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0028_A.mp3",
      "start": 95.548,
      "end": 98.092
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "引擎回報對齊失敗，讓 AI 重試。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0029_B.mp3",
      "start": 98.212,
      "end": 101.548
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "這是閉環回饋，越修越準。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "閉環回饋",
          "en": "Closed-loop Feedback"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0030_B.mp3",
      "start": 101.668,
      "end": 104.836
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "對齊不了，不就一直卡著？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0031_A.mp3",
      "start": 104.956,
      "end": 107.548
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "重試到對上為止，不會亂寫。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0032_B.mp3",
      "start": 107.668,
      "end": 110.74
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "這就像對暗號，錯了就重喊一遍。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0033_B.mp3",
      "start": 110.86,
      "end": 114.052
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "跨好幾個檔案重構，也行？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0034_A.mp3",
      "start": 114.172,
      "end": 117.148
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "行，一次補丁連邏輯帶設定一起改。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "跨檔案重構",
          "en": "Cross-file Refactor"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0035_B.mp3",
      "start": 117.268,
      "end": 121.228
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "連測試都能在同一張補丁補上。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0036_B.mp3",
      "start": 121.348,
      "end": 124.3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "連測試一起寫，真周到。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0037_A.mp3",
      "start": 124.42,
      "end": 127.204
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "這就是 AI 改程式最省力的方式。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0038_B.mp3",
      "start": 127.324,
      "end": 130.972
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "改得少、改得準、改得快。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0039_B.mp3",
      "start": 131.092,
      "end": 134.14
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "以後 AI 改程式像補丁俠，精準又溫柔，咕咕嘎嘎！",
      "_sfx": "咕咕嘎嘎",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_apply_patch_line0040_A.mp3",
      "start": 134.26,
      "end": 138.436
    }
  ]
}